WHAT THIS LICENSE DOES NOT COVER

This license covers the mechanics in this repository — the scripts, the format
specification, the templates, and the documentation. It says nothing about the
material you ingest with them.

Sermon transcripts, recordings, articles, and book excerpts placed in a corpus
built from this template remain the copyrighted works of their authors and
speakers. Storing them for personal study is a separate question from
redistributing them; keep your corpus repository private.

Bible translations are likewise copyrighted, with the exception of translations
explicitly dedicated to the public domain, such as the Berean Standard Bible
that scripts/fetch-bsb installs.
